# One word for each line. A blank line is skipped, and a line that starts with
# `#` is a note. The check is case-insensitive and matches whole words only.
# scripts/check-banned-words.sh reads this file. AGENTS.md states the rule.

# Slop. Write what the thing is.
provenance
leverage
utilize
utilise

# Terminology. AGENTS.md states the word this repo uses instead.
PRD

# British spellings. This repo writes American English.
colour
behaviour
serialise
honoured
cancelled
